WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.626
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:35.896 --> 00:36.896
Grandpa!

3
00:36.980 --> 00:38.188
Grandpa!

4
00:38.730 --> 00:39.771
Grandpa!

5
01:39.313 --> 01:40.313
Dad.

6
01:47.563 --> 01:48.938
Dad!

7
01:58.105 --> 01:59.063
Wat.

8
02:00.730 --> 02:01.855
Is Aim with you?

9
02:10.063 --> 02:11.438
Looking for a flashlight?

10
02:11.521 --> 02:12.563
Yes.

11
02:12.646 --> 02:14.271
It's in there.

12
02:14.355 --> 02:15.771
What are you doing?

13
02:16.771 --> 02:17.896
Dad and Aim are missing.

14
02:18.980 --> 02:20.271
It's not working.

15
02:21.688 --> 02:23.480
-There's another one. -Keep it down.

16
02:24.063 --> 02:25.521
The villagers will come barging in.

17
02:27.396 --> 02:28.896
They really hate your father.

18
02:28.980 --> 02:33.063
They'll have the police detain him and have someone perform an exorcism.

19
02:35.563 --> 02:38.105
He's not possessed. He's just sick.

20
02:38.188 --> 02:39.605
Is Dad often like this?

21
02:39.688 --> 02:41.771
What makes them so sure he's possessed?

22
02:43.355 --> 02:44.855
Why didn't you tell me, Mom?

23
02:44.938 --> 02:48.271
Yes, your father has been acting weird for some time now.

24
02:48.355 --> 02:50.646
But it's never been this bad.

25
02:50.730 --> 02:52.355
You two don't live with him.

26
02:52.438 --> 02:54.021
Aim!

27
02:54.813 --> 02:55.771
Wan.

28
03:00.438 --> 03:02.355
The front gate is still locked.

29
03:02.438 --> 03:03.355
Is it?

30
03:05.646 --> 03:06.855
Aim!

31
03:07.938 --> 03:10.938
Mom, stay here in case Dad comes back.

32
03:11.021 --> 03:13.271
And keep your phone with you, okay?

33
03:14.188 --> 03:15.521
Wan!

34
03:21.646 --> 03:23.646
Guardian spirits of the forest and mountains.

35
03:25.021 --> 03:29.980
May you protect them and guide them home safely.

36
03:30.063 --> 03:32.980
Please don't let anything bad happen to them.

37
04:44.563 --> 04:49.396
DELUSION

38
04:52.021 --> 04:53.105
Dad!

39
04:54.230 --> 04:55.105
Aim!

40
04:57.646 --> 04:58.521
Dad!

41
04:58.605 --> 04:59.605
Wan.

42
05:01.896 --> 05:03.521
Aim.

43
05:09.938 --> 05:10.813
Wan.

44
05:12.063 --> 05:13.063
Look at this.

45
05:33.271 --> 05:34.396
Wan.

46
05:34.480 --> 05:35.313
Wan!

47
05:38.855 --> 05:39.813
Aim!

48
05:41.563 --> 05:42.688
Aim!

49
05:45.188 --> 05:46.021
Wan.

50
05:48.146 --> 05:48.980
Wan.

51
05:49.605 --> 05:50.938
Does Aim have a cell phone?

52
05:58.938 --> 05:59.855
Find it?

53
06:31.230 --> 06:33.271
Grandpa.

54
06:35.438 --> 06:37.896
It hurts, Grandpa. Let me go.

55
06:38.646 --> 06:39.563
It hurts. Let me go.

56
06:39.646 --> 06:41.230
-What are you doing here? -It hurts.

57
06:41.313 --> 06:42.396
What are you doing here?

58
06:43.771 --> 06:47.313
I told you several times not to come here.

59
06:48.896 --> 06:50.980
-Let me go, Grandpa. -This forest is haunted.

60
06:51.688 --> 06:53.521
It will turn you into one.

61
06:53.605 --> 06:55.938
Let me go, Grandpa. You're hurting me.

62
06:56.021 --> 06:57.021
Let me go!

63
06:57.105 --> 06:58.021
-Huh? -Grandpa.

64
06:59.688 --> 07:00.896
Let me go, Grandpa.

65
07:05.271 --> 07:06.563
Let me go!

66
07:17.896 --> 07:19.063
Don't cry.

67
07:19.146 --> 07:20.980
Don't cry.

68
07:21.646 --> 07:22.730
There's no need to cry.

69
07:25.355 --> 07:26.230
No need to cry.

70
07:37.688 --> 07:39.188
-To Big Bird. -Cheers.

71
07:39.271 --> 07:41.105
Congratulations.

72
07:41.188 --> 07:42.855
-Congratulations, friend. -Thanks.

73
07:44.063 --> 07:46.646
You made deputy superintendent real fast. Who's your connection?

74
07:47.313 --> 07:48.355
Help get us promoted too.

75
07:48.438 --> 07:49.771
Find your own connections.

76
07:49.855 --> 07:52.105
My boss has his own.

77
07:52.188 --> 07:53.480
I haven't forgotten you guys.

78
07:53.563 --> 07:54.688
-Good. -Yes.

79
07:54.771 --> 07:56.355
I was waiting for that.

80
08:10.980 --> 08:11.813
Hey.

81
08:12.438 --> 08:13.480
What's the rush?

82
08:15.146 --> 08:16.271
I'm swamped.

83
08:16.896 --> 08:18.230
I'm not free like you guys.

84
08:18.855 --> 08:20.063
You're busy?

85
08:20.146 --> 08:21.771
Busy at your station?

86
08:21.855 --> 08:22.771
Yeah, right.

87
08:22.855 --> 08:24.271
It's so quiet there.

88
08:28.771 --> 08:30.563
Lose the ego, buddy.

89
08:31.063 --> 08:33.105
Just do what your boss says

90
08:34.271 --> 08:36.271
so you can find your way back to Bangkok.

91
08:36.855 --> 08:38.271
Playing the hero

92
08:38.938 --> 08:40.355
won't get you anywhere.

93
08:41.480 --> 08:42.396
Learn to play along.

94
08:47.771 --> 08:49.021
You're wasted.

95
08:49.521 --> 08:51.063
Go back to your seat.

96
08:52.271 --> 08:54.688
Even if you're better at your job,

97
08:54.771 --> 08:56.438
or if you're the best there is,

98
08:57.271 --> 08:59.230
if your boss doesn't pick you…

99
09:02.480 --> 09:03.813
you'll never get anywhere.

100
09:04.480 --> 09:05.396
Trust me.

101
09:10.396 --> 09:11.563
Order some more booze.

102
09:11.646 --> 09:13.230
-Sir Bird. -Big Bird.

103
09:13.313 --> 09:15.646
Cheers!

104
09:21.438 --> 09:24.396
Freeze! Hands up!

105
09:24.480 --> 09:25.771
-Hands up! -Don't move.

106
09:25.855 --> 09:26.730
We're the police.

107
09:26.813 --> 09:28.396
-Collect all the evidence. -Yes, sir.

108
09:28.480 --> 09:30.271
Face down.

109
09:30.855 --> 09:33.980
You're under arrest for operating an illegal online gambling site,

110
09:34.063 --> 09:36.730
money laundering, and importing illegal data into the system.

111
09:36.813 --> 09:37.938
Take them.

112
09:38.021 --> 09:39.563
-Yes, sir. -Hurry!

113
09:39.646 --> 09:41.396
-Walk. -Hands up!

114
09:43.355 --> 09:44.563
Sit down!

115
09:56.480 --> 09:58.438
Why did you make such a big deal out of this?

116
09:58.521 --> 10:02.146
I told you to gather the evidence and bring it to me, didn't I?

117
10:02.813 --> 10:06.021
I thought it was a good opportunity to arrest them and seize the evidence.

118
10:06.105 --> 10:07.813
But this shouldn't have made the news.

119
10:08.855 --> 10:10.563
I haven't cleared it with my superiors.

120
10:13.396 --> 10:16.230
If you have a problem with the way I do things,

121
10:16.813 --> 10:18.688
then you shouldn't work here anymore.

122
10:25.396 --> 10:27.605
I apologize on behalf of my subordinate, sir.

123
10:27.688 --> 10:29.230
Ten million should be enough

124
10:29.730 --> 10:31.146
to keep this out of the news.

125
10:39.521 --> 10:43.188
Damn, that's the way to go.

126
10:50.646 --> 10:52.105
How many more minutes?

127
10:53.688 --> 10:54.688
Okay.

128
10:54.771 --> 10:55.855
Thank you.

129
10:58.855 --> 11:00.146
I think it's around here.

130
11:10.063 --> 11:11.230
Do you hear that?

131
11:27.980 --> 11:28.855
Aim!

132
11:32.896 --> 11:34.480
Are you here, Aim?

133
11:34.563 --> 11:35.688
Aim.

134
11:38.896 --> 11:42.271
Calm down. Where are you going?

135
11:43.313 --> 11:44.188
Calm down.

136
11:47.021 --> 11:47.938
Calm down. I'm here.

137
11:49.438 --> 11:51.355
Take a deep breath.

138
11:51.438 --> 11:52.646
Breathe slowly.

139
12:00.771 --> 12:01.605
Wan.

140
12:02.355 --> 12:04.021
Even if we go in right now,

141
12:04.938 --> 12:06.688
there isn't a trail to follow.

142
12:07.355 --> 12:09.230
And we're not familiar with this forest.

143
12:09.313 --> 12:11.480
I don't think we should go in there just yet.

144
12:13.563 --> 12:15.688
If we don't look for them, then who will?

145
12:18.271 --> 12:20.230
I think we should head out

146
12:20.313 --> 12:21.938
and wait for backup.

147
12:23.271 --> 12:24.813
If you go missing too,

148
12:25.480 --> 12:26.855
it's going to make things worse.

149
12:29.605 --> 12:30.938
Let's wait outside.

150
12:32.855 --> 12:34.063
Come on. Let's go.

151
12:58.188 --> 12:59.980
Hello, ma'am.

152
13:00.063 --> 13:01.438
Where's your daughter?

153
13:02.896 --> 13:04.521
Where did he go this time?

154
13:06.480 --> 13:08.313
He went into the forest.

155
13:08.396 --> 13:10.230
He'll be back soon.

156
13:10.313 --> 13:12.188
My kids are looking for him.

157
13:12.271 --> 13:14.355
Did your husband take your grandson with him?

158
13:15.313 --> 13:16.605
When did he leave?

159
13:16.688 --> 13:18.230
No one knows.

160
13:19.771 --> 13:21.980
You are the cop. Why are you asking all these questions?

161
13:22.063 --> 13:23.896
Why don't you send your men to look for them?

162
13:23.980 --> 13:26.855
You're not from around here. Do you know your way through the forest?

163
13:40.063 --> 13:43.063
Officer, I found Aim's tablet in the forest.

164
14:10.271 --> 14:11.480
Here, Officer.

165
14:38.563 --> 14:42.146
Can dementia cause nosebleeds like this, Doctor?

166
14:48.063 --> 14:50.355
Well, not really.

167
14:51.230 --> 14:53.521
So that means it's not normal, right?

168
14:57.688 --> 15:00.355
Even if he's not in his right mind,

169
15:00.438 --> 15:02.230
my father would never hurt his own grandson.

170
15:11.730 --> 15:13.855
Why did you call the police?

171
15:13.938 --> 15:16.688
People will say your father is a ghost.

172
15:16.771 --> 15:18.813
Things are already bad enough for us.

173
15:19.605 --> 15:21.271
You're worried about gossip,

174
15:22.146 --> 15:23.396
and not about your grandson?

175
15:23.480 --> 15:25.188
I am worried.

176
15:25.271 --> 15:27.938
But why can't we handle this family matter by ourselves?

177
15:28.021 --> 15:29.896
Your father's just been arrested.

178
15:29.980 --> 15:33.730
If the police lock him up again, what are we supposed to do?

179
15:39.896 --> 15:41.730
Do you remember what Aim was wearing?

180
15:43.146 --> 15:46.813
A light green T-shirt and plaid pajama pants.

181
15:48.271 --> 15:50.730
I'll go in first. You wait out here.

182
15:50.813 --> 15:52.521
The patrol officers should be here soon.

183
15:55.688 --> 15:56.688
Sasidit speaking.

184
15:56.771 --> 15:58.646
The child is 150 centimeters tall.

185
15:58.730 --> 16:00.896
He's wearing a light green T-shirt

186
16:00.980 --> 16:02.855
and plaid pajama pants.

187
16:03.521 --> 16:06.980
Search around the house first, then follow me in with the team.

188
16:07.980 --> 16:08.896
Yes, sir.

189
16:10.563 --> 16:11.813
-Let's go. -Okay.

190
16:20.355 --> 16:23.980
I grew up around here. I won't slow you down.

191
16:28.021 --> 16:30.146
Wat, don't go in.

192
16:30.230 --> 16:32.396
Stay with me. I'm scared.

193
16:34.980 --> 16:35.855
Be careful.

194
16:40.521 --> 16:41.355
Hey.

195
17:00.646 --> 17:03.313
Let's go home.

196
17:03.396 --> 17:05.146
Why are you crying?

197
17:26.771 --> 17:28.230
Here, take it.

198
17:29.938 --> 17:32.938
Didn't you want to go fishing at the waterfall?

199
17:33.855 --> 17:35.605
I'm taking you there.

200
17:36.646 --> 17:38.021
Don't cry.

201
17:38.730 --> 17:40.855
You were the one who wanted to come.

202
18:08.563 --> 18:10.521
Nothing on my side.

203
18:10.605 --> 18:13.021
But I'm on the path to the waterfall.

204
18:13.105 --> 18:15.396
I'll go there and take a look.

205
18:15.480 --> 18:18.688
What did you say, Sergeant? I don't understand what you said.

206
18:18.771 --> 18:20.563
He said he hasn't found anything yet.

207
18:20.646 --> 18:22.355
He's checking the waterfall.

208
18:24.730 --> 18:26.105
Go ahead.

209
18:26.188 --> 18:28.646
-Keep me updated if anything comes up. -Yes, sir.

210
18:29.438 --> 18:30.813
Aim.

211
18:31.730 --> 18:32.563
Aim.

212
18:35.396 --> 18:37.188
Your father's condition is getting worse.

213
18:37.980 --> 18:39.146
What do you mean?

214
18:40.230 --> 18:41.063
Well,

215
18:42.021 --> 18:43.896
your father's episodes are more frequent.

216
18:44.438 --> 18:46.521
Don't you think he could be dangerous to others?

217
18:46.605 --> 18:48.855
Your family has another senior and a child in it.

218
18:48.938 --> 18:50.521
So what do you expect me to do?

219
18:50.605 --> 18:52.188
I don't know either.

220
18:52.271 --> 18:54.063
It's your family. You deal with it.

221
18:54.146 --> 18:57.105
I just think that, if his episodes keep happening more often,

222
18:57.605 --> 18:59.021
it could get even worse.

223
19:00.396 --> 19:04.105
He disappeared into the forest with a kid. Who knows what he's thinking?

224
19:04.896 --> 19:07.105
Once he starts taking his medication, he'll get better.

225
19:10.396 --> 19:12.855
My father isn't a violent man. He wouldn't hurt anyone.

226
19:15.271 --> 19:16.438
Aim!

227
19:20.271 --> 19:21.313
Aim!

228
19:30.646 --> 19:32.146
Let me help, Mom.

229
19:32.230 --> 19:33.355
-No need. -Come on.

230
19:34.313 --> 19:37.188
Your sister never helps me.

231
19:37.271 --> 19:40.688
Who knows what she does at her husband's house?

232
19:40.771 --> 19:43.521
They might say we never taught her any better.

233
19:44.230 --> 19:45.396
Eat something.

234
20:03.605 --> 20:05.646
Aren't you worried Dad won't come back?

235
20:12.855 --> 20:16.396
If he dies or disappears, that'd be better than him being possessed.

236
20:28.355 --> 20:29.355
Nee.

237
20:32.313 --> 20:33.396
Hello, Uncle.

238
20:35.355 --> 20:38.480
Long time no see. How have you been?

239
20:46.438 --> 20:48.896
Mom, your brother's here to see you.

240
21:03.146 --> 21:05.896
Hasn't the Phii Pong brought the child back yet?

241
21:12.771 --> 21:13.605
Here.

242
21:15.105 --> 21:17.438
Write Aim's name across its chest.

243
21:18.605 --> 21:19.938
If Narong comes back,

244
21:20.563 --> 21:22.813
let me cast a spell on him

245
21:22.896 --> 21:24.521
so he won't be too badly affected.

246
21:30.813 --> 21:33.563
Can you stop saying nonsense?

247
21:33.646 --> 21:35.396
My father is just sick.

248
21:37.021 --> 21:38.271
And what's this, Uncle?

249
21:39.063 --> 21:40.688
Take it back. I don't want it.

250
21:40.771 --> 21:41.646
Hey.

251
21:42.230 --> 21:43.438
Keep it.

252
21:44.146 --> 21:46.563
Once a spirit possesses someone, it's hard to drive it out.

253
21:46.646 --> 21:49.480
You have to perform a ritual to make it leave.

254
21:49.563 --> 21:52.563
A city kid like you wouldn't understand.

255
21:53.230 --> 21:59.438
Your mother grew up around the forest. She knows what has to be done.

256
22:02.021 --> 22:04.605
All right, Uncle. How about this?

257
22:05.438 --> 22:06.980
Let's stay out of each other's way.

258
22:07.563 --> 22:10.063
I'll have my father take his medicine and see a doctor.

259
22:10.146 --> 22:13.146
You can perform whatever rituals you want.

260
22:14.230 --> 22:17.355
Just stay away from my parents.

261
22:18.230 --> 22:19.730
That's all.

262
22:22.896 --> 22:27.063
The medicine you've studied can't cure everything.

263
22:27.646 --> 22:32.355
I've helped countless people as a shaman.

264
22:33.021 --> 22:35.355
Let me know what you want to do, Nee.

265
23:03.146 --> 23:04.271
Aim!

266
23:04.980 --> 23:06.271
Aim!

267
23:06.355 --> 23:07.771
Aim!

268
23:07.855 --> 23:09.146
Aim!

269
23:13.063 --> 23:14.813
-Aim! -Aim!

270
23:16.480 --> 23:17.438
Aim.

271
23:30.021 --> 23:31.396
Aim!

272
23:32.813 --> 23:33.730
Hey.

273
23:33.813 --> 23:35.896
Step back. Stay away.

274
23:37.188 --> 23:38.980
This is a crime scene.

275
23:39.063 --> 23:41.813
Listen to me. Wait here, I'll take care of it.

276
24:05.980 --> 24:06.980
Sergeant.

277
24:07.063 --> 24:08.521
I found a dead body.

278
24:08.605 --> 24:11.146
I believe it's Mued, the missing person from the report.

279
24:11.730 --> 24:13.230
We're not far from the waterfall.

280
24:14.230 --> 24:17.271
Look for a large tree with three-colored cloth tied around it.

281
24:17.813 --> 24:18.980
Notify the station.

282
24:19.063 --> 24:20.646
Send forensics and the coroner.

283
24:21.230 --> 24:22.230
Over.

284
24:23.896 --> 24:24.938
Hey.

285
24:29.938 --> 24:31.146
Sergeant.

286
24:31.230 --> 24:33.230
I think Aim is somewhere near the scene.

287
24:38.396 --> 24:39.980
Grandpa.

288
24:43.146 --> 24:44.730
Grandpa, no.

289
24:48.188 --> 24:49.771
No.

290
24:56.021 --> 24:56.855
Come on.

291
24:56.938 --> 25:01.230
Let's go home, Grandpa. Mom will worry.

292
25:03.021 --> 25:03.896
Come on.

293
25:07.896 --> 25:10.646
Look, there are fish in the water.

294
25:10.730 --> 25:12.021
Want to see?

295
25:12.938 --> 25:13.771
Here.

296
25:16.355 --> 25:19.521
Look, so many fish.

297
25:20.438 --> 25:24.313
Right here. There's a fish. See?

298
25:24.396 --> 25:26.146
Here.

299
25:27.105 --> 25:27.938
Fish.

300
25:29.271 --> 25:31.521
Fish, so many of them.

301
25:32.980 --> 25:34.396
So many fish.

302
25:35.271 --> 25:36.521
Fish.

303
25:46.646 --> 25:47.855
Where are you going?

304
25:49.271 --> 25:50.813
Don't you want to look at the fish?!

305
25:52.896 --> 25:55.021
Grandpa, let's go home.

306
26:09.271 --> 26:11.313
I'm not your grandpa.

307
26:13.271 --> 26:16.813
You're a bad kid.

308
26:16.896 --> 26:20.563
You need to be punished. I'll punish you myself.

309
26:21.271 --> 26:22.105
Phii Pong.

310
26:22.188 --> 26:24.563
You really are a Phii Pong.

311
26:25.396 --> 26:26.396
Help me, Mom!

312
26:26.480 --> 26:28.230
Help me!

313
26:28.313 --> 26:29.813
Mom!

314
26:39.855 --> 26:41.563
A brat like you…

315
26:43.230 --> 26:44.771
belongs in this forest.

316
26:44.855 --> 26:46.563
You're never going home to your mother.

317
26:46.646 --> 26:48.646
Go on. Get in the water.

318
26:48.730 --> 26:49.730
Go!

319
26:53.563 --> 26:54.646
No, Grandpa.

320
26:56.646 --> 26:58.605
I want to go home, Grandpa.

321
26:58.688 --> 27:00.021
-Let me go! -Go on.

322
27:00.105 --> 27:01.521
Let me go!

323
27:01.605 --> 27:02.938
-Go on. -Let me go!

324
27:03.021 --> 27:04.063
I want to go home.

325
27:05.855 --> 27:07.438
-I want to go home. -Go!

326
27:07.521 --> 27:08.855
No, Grandpa. Let me go!

327
27:09.605 --> 27:10.771
Get in the water.

328
27:10.855 --> 27:13.230
-No, Grandpa! -Go!

329
27:13.313 --> 27:15.146
-Let me go! -Go!

330
28:05.480 --> 28:06.896
Aim!

331
28:19.688 --> 28:20.771
Aim!

332
28:22.480 --> 28:23.563
Stay calm, Aim.

333
28:25.855 --> 28:26.855
Stay calm.

334
28:26.938 --> 28:28.021
You're fine now.

335
28:39.313 --> 28:40.438
Aim.

336
28:41.105 --> 28:42.230
Aim.

337
28:42.313 --> 28:43.355
Aim.

338
28:43.938 --> 28:44.813
Aim.

339
29:06.230 --> 29:07.313
Aim.

340
29:07.396 --> 29:08.230
Aim, Son.

341
29:08.313 --> 29:09.688
-That way. -Let's go.

342
29:16.146 --> 29:17.896
-Let's go. -Aim.

343
29:19.771 --> 29:20.688
Take him.

344
29:22.271 --> 29:23.105
Let's go.

345
30:12.605 --> 30:15.605
CHIANG KHAN POLICE

346
30:29.146 --> 30:30.563
Could I have a bandage, please?

347
30:33.105 --> 30:34.355
Hey.

348
30:37.521 --> 30:38.355
Could you…

349
30:38.938 --> 30:40.730
tell other officers

350
30:41.271 --> 30:43.271
not to use force on my father?

351
30:44.146 --> 30:45.646
He doesn't know what he's doing.

352
31:07.646 --> 31:08.521
Aim.

353
31:12.480 --> 31:13.605
Look what you've done.

354
31:14.813 --> 31:17.438
You keep bringing trouble to this family.

355
32:07.188 --> 32:09.980
We did everything Sak told us to do.

356
32:10.730 --> 32:12.896
And my grandson still hasn't come home.

357
32:16.021 --> 32:19.105
Grannie, please calm down. Don't cry yet.

358
32:19.813 --> 32:21.730
The shaman hasn't said anything.

359
32:23.896 --> 32:25.896
Just let her cry.

360
32:26.771 --> 32:28.480
Don't stop her.

361
32:35.230 --> 32:36.980
Mued is dead.

362
32:38.896 --> 32:40.355
The ghost took him away.

363
32:41.813 --> 32:45.563
It's too powerful. There's nothing we can do now.

364
32:59.646 --> 33:02.521
Collect the soil, teeth, and any traces of evidence for testing.

365
33:03.188 --> 33:05.021
The killer must've left something behind.

366
33:06.938 --> 33:09.105
If the killer's a ghost, what evidence would it leave?

367
33:10.355 --> 33:11.980
Be careful handling filth like this.

368
33:12.938 --> 33:14.938
You don't want something to latch onto you.

369
33:16.563 --> 33:18.480
If the killer really is a ghost,

370
33:18.563 --> 33:20.771
then we'll arrest that ghost.

371
33:28.188 --> 33:30.271
Inspector, you shouldn't say things like that.

372
33:31.146 --> 33:32.063
It's just…

373
33:32.146 --> 33:34.605
people here believe this forest is crawling with Phii Pong.

374
33:36.563 --> 33:41.105
And decades ago, a child was murdered right here.

375
33:41.813 --> 33:43.063
His face was mangled.

376
33:44.396 --> 33:45.438
He was lying face down.

377
33:47.355 --> 33:49.605
His guts had been torn out just like this.

378
33:52.438 --> 33:53.688
Sergeant.

379
33:53.771 --> 33:55.271
The people here

380
33:55.938 --> 33:57.563
have watched too many ghost shows.

381
33:58.646 --> 34:00.688
If it really was a ghost, it'd be a spirit.

382
34:00.771 --> 34:03.521
How's a ghost supposed to hold a knife and tear out someone's guts?

383
34:12.980 --> 34:14.105
Excuse me.

384
34:29.438 --> 34:31.188
I'm here with news about Mued.

385
34:31.813 --> 34:34.730
The police have found his body.

386
34:34.813 --> 34:36.271
He was found dead in the forest.

387
34:37.063 --> 34:38.146
Just to be sure…

388
34:38.230 --> 34:39.896
So what do we do now?

389
34:39.980 --> 34:41.855
It's become this violent already.

390
34:43.938 --> 34:46.396
First, we have to find out

391
34:46.480 --> 34:48.355
who it's possessing.

392
34:49.771 --> 34:51.105
Anyone…

393
34:51.605 --> 34:55.271
who wanders around at night,

394
34:55.355 --> 35:00.021
and comes out of the forest acting strangely,

395
35:00.105 --> 35:03.521
with a darkened face, eating filthy things…

396
35:04.271 --> 35:06.730
We'll have to perform an exorcism on them.

397
35:18.480 --> 35:20.730
We found hair on the body.

398
35:20.813 --> 35:23.813
We could run a DNA test. It might help us identify the suspect.

399
35:29.105 --> 35:30.938
You don't remember even a little, sir?

400
35:31.521 --> 35:33.230
Are you listening?

401
36:08.313 --> 36:09.605
How's Aim doing now?

402
36:10.855 --> 36:12.355
We're still monitoring his condition.

403
36:13.063 --> 36:15.813
But I don't think it's anything serious.

404
36:16.521 --> 36:18.396
Don't forget to remind them to check his lungs.

405
36:18.480 --> 36:19.771
Okay.

406
36:21.480 --> 36:22.938
How's Dad?

407
36:26.980 --> 36:27.980
I have to go.

408
36:28.605 --> 36:30.188
How is he?

409
36:31.105 --> 36:32.563
How's my father, Officer?

410
36:32.646 --> 36:34.230
He won't say a word.

411
36:35.521 --> 36:38.646
Won't this make Pannee's situation worse?

412
36:39.521 --> 36:41.105
I warned her

413
36:41.188 --> 36:45.521
to drive the Phii Pong out of Narong

414
36:46.313 --> 36:48.646
before someone died.

415
36:50.355 --> 36:52.438
My grandson is fine now.

416
36:52.521 --> 36:54.855
Can I ask his mother not to press charges?

417
36:54.938 --> 36:55.855
Just let him go.

418
36:55.938 --> 36:57.896
I still can't let him go.

419
36:57.980 --> 36:59.688
We have to keep him for questioning.

420
36:59.771 --> 37:02.021
Right now, he's a suspect in a murder case.

421
42:55.771 --> 43:00.771
Subtitle translation by: Parida Kim
